---
/**
 * How to read the diagram: what an arrow's head means, what its side means, and
 * what the mark on a caption means.
 *
 * It sits **outside** the figure and stays in the accessibility tree even though
 * the drawing does not. Two of its entries are about the picture and cost a
 * reader who cannot see it nothing; the other two are the legend's real job —
 * the reason mark names the column the table carries as "Motivo obligatorio",
 * and "sin salida" names the mark that answers why a state refuses every move.
 *
 * The swatches draw their own arrowheads instead of referencing a `<marker>`:
 * this component renders once per workflow, and a marker carries an `id`, which
 * is document-wide. Two legends would be two elements with one id.
 */
---

<ul class="legend small">
  <li class="entry">
    <span class="swatch" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 40 14" width="40" height="14" focusable="false">
        <path
          d="M5 11 C 5 1, 35 1, 35 11"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="1.5"></path>
        <path d="M31.8 6 L38.2 6 L35 11.6 Z" fill="currentColor"></path>
      </svg>
    </span>
    <span>
      La punta de la flecha señala el destino: sale del estado de origen y entra
      en el de destino.
    </span>
  </li>

  <li class="entry">
    <span class="swatch" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 40 14" width="40" height="14" focusable="false">
        <path
          d="M35 3 C 35 13, 5 13, 5 3"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="1.5"></path>
        <path d="M1.8 8 L8.2 8 L5 2.4 Z" fill="currentColor"></path>
      </svg>
    </span>
    <span>
      Las flechas de arriba avanzan en el orden del flujo; las de abajo vuelven
      a un estado anterior.
    </span>
  </li>

  <li class="entry">
    <span class="swatch" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="chip tone-ambar">Mover<b>*</b></span>
    </span>
    <span>
      Un asterisco junto al nombre del movimiento: ese paso pide un motivo
      escrito.
    </span>
  </li>

  <li class="entry">
    <span class="swatch" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="chip">sin salida</span>
    </span>
    <span>
      De un estado marcado <b>sin salida</b> no parte ninguna flecha. Entre dos estados
      sin flecha tampoco hay paso posible.
    </span>
  </li>
</ul>

<style>
  .legend {
    display: grid;
    /* `min()` rather than a bare track floor: below 300px of usable width the
       floor would win and push the legend past the page edge. */
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(300px, 100%), 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-2) var(--space-5);
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);
    border-radius: var(--radius-control);
    background-color: var(--pozo);
  }

  .entry {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .swatch {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: var(--space-8);
    color: var(--tinta-suave);
    flex: none;
  }

  .swatch .chip {
    text-transform: none;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }
</style>
